<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH RPIX CLOSES HIGHER BUT ACTIVITY STAYS THIN.</title>
<headline>CZECH RPIX CLOSES HIGHER BUT ACTIVITY STAYS THIN.</headline>
<text>
<p>1200 GMT - The Czech RPIX closes sharply higher on Monday led by major issues.</p>
<p>*  .RPIX rises 19.2 points, 1.86 percent, to 1,049.5.</p>
<p>* Turnover, 16.4 million crowns.</p>
<p>* CEZ gains 32 crowns to 952.</p>
<p>* SPT Telecom up 89 crowns to 3,150.</p>
<p>* Komercni Banka rises 31 crowns to 1,975.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
